      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Piedmont Virginia Community College (PVCC) does not offer on-campus housing because it is primarily a commuter college. Students have various renting options in the surrounding area, including apartments, rental homes, and shared living spaces. PVCC's Student Services office offers resources for students seeking nearby housing, including a housing database students can trust. Charlottesville is a vibrant college town so students can easily find peers to live and socialise with in off-campus accommodation.</p>",
      "image": null,
